      <ttm:item type="album">STRINGS (feat. JVKE &amp; Bazzi)</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">7roB6h5rQPhFRK307eIQk6</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>02:33.000</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:03.150" end="00:06.080" ttm:agent="v1">Hmm</p>
      <p begin="00:06.080" end="00:08.430" ttm:agent="v1">I hear strings play</p>
      <p begin="00:08.430" end="00:12.220" ttm:agent="v1">Every time you look my way</p>
      <p begin="00:12.220" end="00:16.030" ttm:agent="v1">Don't you know that's what you do?</p>
      <p begin="00:16.030" end="00:19.390" ttm:agent="v1">Feels like ooh</p>
      <p begin="00:19.390" end="00:21.830" ttm:agent="v1">Make my heart beat</p>
      <p begin="00:21.830" end="00:25.400" ttm:agent="v1">Double time when you're on me</p>
      <p begin="00:25.400" end="00:30.220" ttm:agent="v1">Don't you know that's what you do?</p>
      <p begin="00:30.220" end="00:32.340" ttm:agent="v1">What you do, what you do</p>
      <p begin="00:32.340" end="00:35.480" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you mute out all the nonsense, all the toxic</p>
      <p begin="00:35.480" end="00:38.970" ttm:agent="v1">We can talk on any topic and never stop it</p>
      <p begin="00:38.970" end="00:42.250" ttm:agent="v1">I know you got other options, a lot of prospects</p>
      <p begin="00:42.250" end="00:46.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But they only know the single, I want the box set (ooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.890" end="00:50.430" ttm:agent="v1">Pushin' buttons with your high heels or your high tops</p>
      <p begin="00:50.430" end="00:54.370" ttm:agent="v1">Turnin' heads and give 'em all the feels, way that you walk</p>
      <p begin="00:54.370" end="00:57.260" ttm:agent="v1">Could be a sign or I</p>
      <p begin="00:57.260" end="00:59.150" ttm:agent="v1">Might be losin' my mind</p>
      <p begin="00:59.150" end="01:01.830" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I hear strings play</p>
      <p begin="01:01.830" end="01:05.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Every time you look my way (hey)</p>
      <p begin="01:05.550" end="01:09.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't you know that's what you do? (Girl, you know that's what you do)</p>
      <p begin="01:09.140" end="01:12.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Feels like ooh (ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:12.710" end="01:15.160" ttm:agent="v1">Make my heart beat</p>
      <p begin="01:15.160" end="01:18.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Double time when you're on me (on me)</p>
      <p begin="01:18.970" end="01:22.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't you know that's what you do? (Girl, you know that's what you do)</p>
      <p begin="01:22.010" end="01:25.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ayy, yeah) what you do, what you do</p>
      <p begin="01:25.380" end="01:29.050" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you sound just like the theme song, can turn my dreams on</p>
      <p begin="01:29.050" end="01:32.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You the star of a movie, I'm watchin' re-runs (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:32.210" end="01:35.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Wanna cut off all my options, put you on top of them (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:35.630" end="01:40.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">We just stepped outside in public, the cameras poppin' (ooh)</p>
      <p begin="01:40.110" end="01:43.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Hold on to me right now, I'll protect you (hey, hey)</p>
      <p begin="01:43.370" end="01:46.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You can ruin my life, girl, I'll let you (hey, hey, hey)</p>
      <p begin="01:46.990" end="01:49.890" ttm:agent="v1">Feel your heart when it's beating, you the one, girl, and I'm fiendin'</p>
      <p begin="01:49.890" end="01:52.590" ttm:agent="v1">I hear symphonies when you speakin', it's true</p>
      <p begin="01:52.590" end="01:54.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause I hear strings play (ah, ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:54.820" end="01:58.730" ttm:agent="v1">Every time you look my way</p>
      <p begin="01:58.730" end="02:02.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't you know that's what you do? (Hey, hey)</p>
      <p begin="02:02.680" end="02:05.950" ttm:agent="v1">Feels like ooh</p>
      <p begin="02:05.950" end="02:08.540" ttm:agent="v1">Make my heart beat</p>
      <p begin="02:08.540" end="02:12.100" ttm:agent="v1">Double time when you're on me</p>
      <p begin="02:12.100" end="02:16.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't you know that's what you do? (Girl, you know that's what you do)</p>
      <p begin="02:16.890" end="02:19.320" ttm:agent="v1">What you do, what you do, ooh</p>
      <p begin="02:19.320" end="02:23.580" ttm:agent="v1">Hmm</p>
      <p begin="02:23.580" end="02:25.080" ttm:agent="v1">What you do</p>
      <p begin="02:24.600" end="02:28.600" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
